A '''Backpacker''' (Japanese: '''バックパッカー''' ''Backpacker'') is a type of {{DL|Pokémon Trainer|Trainer class}} introduced in [[Generation V]]. They are young men and women who carry large [[bag|backpacks]] and most often use only one Pokémon.

In [[Generation V]], Backpackers at [[Big Stadium and Small Court]] give out [[Max Repel]]s when defeated. A large number of Backpackers can be found in [[Nacrene City]].

In [[Generation VI]], only male Backpackers are present. They appear to be a younger version of a {{tc|Hiker}}. Outside the [[Battle Maison]], most of them only use {{type|Normal}} Pokémon. 

In [[Generation VII]], there are only female Backpackers, whose design is similar to the one in [[Generation V]]. At the [[Battle Royal Dome]], Backpackers specialize in {{t|Rock}}- and {{type|Ground}} Pokémon. At the [[Battle Tree]], Backpackers exclusively use [[Legendary Pokémon]] during later battles.

In [[Generation VIII]], only female Backpackers appear. Their design is different from that of previous female Backpackers, as they have black hair and wear headbands and worn-out jeans. In the {{gal|Battle Tower}}, Backpackers specialize in {{t|Flying}}- and {{type|Ground}} Pokémon.

In [[Generation IX]], only male Backpackers appear. They have longer, straighter hair than previous male Backpackers and wear tank tops.

