===={{MangaArc|Sword & Shield}}====
In ''[[PASS18|Chomp!! It's Dracovish]]'', a female Backpacker who was a {{tc|Macro Cosmos's}} in disguise was sent with her cohorts to [[Route 9 Tunnel]] to dispose of a wild {{p|Dracovish}} that suddenly [[Dynamax]]ed. The Dracovish was saved by [[Marvin]], who used his [[Sniffler]] to stun everyone long enough for him to catch Dracovish and escape. Afterward, they reported their failure to [[Oleana]] and were ordered to stand by in [[Wyndon]].
