==Trivia==
* According to an NPC, [[Professor Juniper]] and [[Cedric Juniper|her father]] were once Backpackers. Backpacker Jill, as well as Juniper herself during a [[Xtransceiver]] call, make similar claims in [[Pokémon Black and White Versions 2|Black 2 and White 2]].
* In Black 2 and White 2, Backpacker Mae claims that she was once a member of [[Team Plasma]].
* In [[Pokémon GO]], "Backpacker" is the name of an achievement {{GO|medal}} awarded for visiting at least 10 [[PokéStop]]s.
* Backpacker Amaury is the only Trainer in {{pkmn|Legends: Z-A}} to have no Pokémon related by [[List of Pokémon by evolutionary line|evolutionary line]] kept from their initial battle to their [[rematch]] battles. This is likely an error as Amaury's rematch team instead resembles Backpacker Antoine's team.

